  "description": "WESXAW crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C80 H96 Dy6 N8 O28 2+,2(C1 H4 O1),2(C2 H3 N1),2(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.507-3.908 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.52-113.28°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6(L1)4(μ3-OH)4(MeOH)4]Cl2·2MeOH·2MeCN (C86H110Cl2Dy6N10O30). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
